// Forge-only pi-permission-system policy. ralph.ps1 sets PI_PERMISSION_SYSTEM_POLICY_AGENT_DIR=C:\Users\derek\.pi\forge-policy for Forge passes only;
// every other agent (Household finance loop included) keeps C:\Users\derek\.pi\agent\pi-permissions.jsonc unchanged.
// forgeopen 2026-10-23 (ALI-163). Derrick 1:53 PM CT: "Really anything secrets cause it's gotta do the finance stuff". 1:52 PM CT: "Even looser only restricted
// secrets and finances. Other than that it just needs to keep a log". 11:09 AM CT: "Yes don't be so restrictive to forge wtf".
// Layout: pi-permission-system README (default policy per category + resource-qualified path rules, last matching rule wins): allow by default, deny secrets.
